                <pb facs="0686" n="574" sameAs="frus:frus1907p1/pg574"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 1229/7.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Third Assistant Secretary of State to the
                        Vice-Consul Sarle</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-04-29"><hi rendition="#italic">April 29,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>United States has relinquished its extraterritorial jurisdiction in Zanzibar.
                    Close consular court at once. Forward court records to department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
